                                <a class='news-article__figure-link' href="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/quest-month-week-3--tfa-practice-mode?oldschool=1" id='news-article-fig-3' data-test='news-article-fig-3'>
                                    <img class='news-article__figure-img' src="https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2026/Newsposts/2026-11-17/thm.png" alt="As we move into the third week of Quest Month, two more fresh adventures await, along with handy new rewards to unlock!" title="As we move into the third week of Quest Month, two more fresh adventures await, along with handy new rewards to unlock!" id='news-article-img-3' data-test='news-article-img-3'/>
                                </a>
