                        <article class='news-article '>
                            <figure class='news-article__figure'>
                                <a class='news-article__figure-link' href="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/melvor-idle-2-a-runescape-adventure---early-access-out-now?oldschool=1" id='news-article-fig-4' data-test='news-article-fig-4'>
                                    <img class='news-article__figure-img' src="https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2026/Newsposts/2026-11-17/Newspost.jpg" alt="Melvor Idle 2: A RuneScape Adventure is out now in Early Access!" title="Melvor Idle 2: A RuneScape Adventure is out now in Early Access!" id='news-article-img-4' data-test='news-article-img-4'/>
                                </a>
                            </figure>
                            <div class='news-article__details'>
                                <h3 class='news-article__title'><a class='secondary-link' href="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/melvor-idle-2-a-runescape-adventure---early-access-out-now?oldschool=1">Melvor Idle 2: A RuneScape Adventure - Early Access Out Now!</a></h3>
                                <span class='news-article__sub'>Community <time datetime='2026-11-17' class='news-article__time'>17 November 2026</time></span>
                                <p class='news-article__summary'>Melvor Idle 2: A RuneScape Adventure is out now in Early Access! <a class='secondary-link news-article__read-more' href="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/melvor-idle-2-a-runescape-adventure---early-access-out-now?oldschool=1" id='news-article-link-4' data-test='news-article-link-4'>Read More...</a></p>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                        <article class='news-article '>
                            <figure class='news-article__figure'>
                                <a class='news-article__figure-link' href="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/jagex-accounts-now-required-heres-what-to-do?oldschool=1" id='news-article-fig-5' data-test='news-article-fig-5'>
                                    <img class='news-article__figure-img' src="https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2023/newsposts/thumbnail/THUMBNAIL-Statement.png" alt="Legacy accounts are finally being universally upgraded to a more modern, secure account system." title="Legacy accounts are finally being universally upgraded to a more modern, secure account system." id='news-article-img-5' data-test='news-article-img-5'/>
                                </a>
                            </figure>
                            <div class='news-article__details'>
                                <h3 class='news-article__title'><a class='secondary-link' href="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/jagex-accounts-now-required-heres-what-to-do?oldschool=1">Jagex Accounts Now Required: Here's What To Do</a></h3>
                                <span class='news-article__sub'>Technical <time datetime='2026-11-17' class='news-article__time'>17 November 2026</time></span>
                                <p class='news-article__summary'>Legacy accounts are finally being universally upgraded to a more modern, secure account system. <a class='secondary-link news-article__read-more' href="https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/jagex-accounts-now-required-heres-what-to-do?oldschool=1" id='news-article-link-5' data-test='news-article-link-5'>Read More...</a></p>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    <p class='content__copy content__copy--center'>You can also follow our <a id='home-copy-twitter' data-test='oshome-twitter' class='secondary-link' href='https://www.twitter.com/OldSchoolRS' target='_blank' rel="noopener">Twitter</a> feed for the latest news &amp; updates or view older posts in our <a id='home-copy-news' data-test='oshome-news-archive' class='secondary-link' href='https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/archive?oldschool=1'>news archive</a>.</p>
			</section>
